1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,000
Once upon a time there was a little piece of wood in the workshop.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:08,000
Geppetto wanted to read a new book and speak with Pinocchio.

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:12,000
Every word of the story becomes clear when you listen to the voice.

4
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:16,500
In the morning the sun lights up the street and the city square.

5
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:21,000
Learning a new language always brings great joy.
